toolArguments.prompt:
Use case: ui-mockup.
Create a polished high resolution landscape raster production art board for GeoGuard, Chinese desktop only. Title "DUI01 / 桌面九塔建造栏". Four clearly labeled panels, generous typography, no phones. References: image1 approved UI01 gives style and approved BASIC/BURST/PLAYER forms; image2 canonical CANNON/SNIPER upper/lower NEUTRAL; image3 canonical RAIL/RAPID upper/lower NEUTRAL; image4 canonical MORTAR/FROST upper/lower NEUTRAL; image5 canonical SENTINEL first NEUTRAL. All bodies from these canonical sources, faceless honey player one leaf. Keep original organs and launcher distinctions, never redraw all towers as identical blobs. Cream #FFF9EF, warm brown #4B281C text/rounded outline, sage #B6D4AE allies. Currency ALL mint #A8D8BC diamonds dark green thin edge, NEVER blue diamonds. Flat sparse background, no new units/obstacles.
Composition: landscape about 2400x1800. A top large LEFT complete desktop viewport labeled "A 标准桌面 1440×900", with corner HP100/100, center WAVE32 / 06:42, money60 and 暂停 top right, open battlefield with only canonical honey player and BASIC tower. Bottom anchored horizontally scrolling cream card strip max920 logical px, cardwidth140, gap8, bottom24. This bar has nine cards in total but viewport shows six full cards in source order BASIC to FROST plus clearly clipped seventh RAIL at RIGHT. Render a real continuous horizontal scrollbar beneath cards, thumb visibly at LEFT end; modest right edge fade, clipped card indicates overflow. Arrow mouse pointer resting on thumb, short outside viewport annotation "拖动水平滚动条滑块，查看余下塔卡". This is scrollbar not an extra next/prev button. No nav arrow controls.
B top RIGHT companion END-position SAME DESKTOP complete viewport, same HUD/gameplay frame, bottom same width/cards scroll at right: clipped prior SNIPER on left then RAPID/MORTAR/FROST/RAIL/BURST/SENTINEL fully, scrollbar thumb at RIGHT, cursor on thumb. Clearly show final 哨戒塔. Do not condense all9 to microicons.
C middle full width "C 九塔顺序展开 · 外部原画源条（不是另一种游戏栏）": ALL NINE individual full-size cards horizontally presented in exact source order, same card hierarchy. Primary biggest dark name and cost with mint diamond; thumbnail second; smaller but legible Lv and category/interval. Extra UP+ badge when level>1. Low funds cards readable deep brown cost/name, light coral border plus textual "资金不足"; not disabled/no lock. Nine EXACT values:
速射塔 diamond20 / Lv.2/4 / 单体 · 0.28秒 / UP+1;
榴弹炮 diamond40 / Lv.1/4 / 范围 · 1.5秒;
穿透塔 diamond140 / Lv.3/4 / 穿透 · 1.73秒 / UP+2 / 资金不足;
链锯塔 diamond28 / Lv.1/4 / 单体 · 0.12秒;
迫击塔 diamond95 / Lv.2/4 / 范围 · 2.14秒 / UP+1 / 资金不足;
霜冻塔 diamond55 / Lv.1/4 / 减速 · 0.85秒;
磁轨塔 diamond98 / Lv.1/4 / 穿透 · 1.65秒 / 资金不足;
散射塔 diamond87 / Lv.2/4 / 散射 · 0.88秒 / UP+1 / 资金不足;
哨戒塔 diamond120 / Lv.4/4 / 单体 · 0.44秒 / UP+3 / 资金不足.
Bodies: BASIC short single tube, CANNON giant barrel one bore, SNIPER long neck single pointed bill, RAPID two stacked SHORT tubes, MORTAR upward diagonal cup one rear triangular bud, FROST horizontal whistle+two side fins+two belly stripes, RAIL long neck two LONG parallel tubes, BURST square group FOUR equal bores 2x2, SENTINEL two shoulder pads one dark eyeslot with one bright dot + one short tube. Do not swap SNIPER and RAIL, RAPID and BURST, or FROST and MORTAR.
D bottom smaller complete desktop viewport "D 较小窗口 960×720": same HP/wave/time/money/pause and canonical player, same fixed card size, FIVE full cards plus next FROST clipped, scrolling thumb, no mobile layout. Neighbor outside specification small text "身份 / 费用一级 · 等级 / 类别 / 间隔二级" and "不足仍可左键起拖，松开再判定" and "卡宽140 · 间距8 · 栏宽min(92vw,920px)". All annotations outside gameplay frame.
No hover detail in this board, no skills, no context menu, no upgrades button, no debug, no permanent joystick, no extra footer control. All text deep brown on pale fills, no white pale-green labels. No technical root/axis lines in thumbnails. Footer "桌面原画目标 · 动态字段示例 · 非实机验证". This is production art raster, beautiful coherent warm sticker UI, strong primary hierarchy not a cluttered spreadsheet.
